    },
    "konjiki-metallurgy": {
      "status": "note",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "note",
          "text": "After a rest: Metallurgy Armor or a coated weapon until your next rest (both at 11th). Weapon: an ammunition die of d12 that can't shrink, and one property (Geometric Makeup: Fortified and Blocking 1; Counter weight: can't be disarmed, Thrown 20/40 and Return; Shearing Edge: once per turn on a hit, −1 AC or −2 DR until your next turn; Rebounding Line: once per turn, 5 over AC, the next attack on you is at disadvantage). Armor (Reinforced Cloth, Shinobi Combat Jacket or Jonin Armor, Bulk 1) with one property (Anchored Greaves, Elemental Deflection Plates, Expanding Plates, Smart Armor, Kinetic Raiment). Set them on the item."
        }
      ]
    },
